<title>TURKEY: Turkish shares firmed in correction.</title>
<headline>Turkish shares firmed in correction.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkish stocks firmed in Thursday's morning session on a correction after falling in the last three days on inflation fears.</p>
<p>The IMKB National-100 rose 2.08 percent or 40 points to 1,959. Trade volume was boosted by 73 percent to 13.7 trillion lira from Wednesday's 7.9 trillion.</p>
</text>
